                <head>Appendix L to HD–99</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note by the British
                    Delegation</hi></p>
                <p>Information has been received from Copenhagen showing that the German authorities
                    intend to demobilize some of their military and naval forces at Flensburg and to
                    provide them with civilian occupations within the plebiscite area.</p>
                <p>In the view of His Britannic Majesty’s Government it would be desirable to inform
                    the German Government at once that this proceeding will not be allowed.</p>
            </div>
